  "order": 15,
  "title": {
    "zh": "125例医案的数据规律：疗效等级、诊数、用穴、选经与手法",
    "en": "Patterns Across the 125 Cases: Outcome Grades, Visit Numbers, Points, Channels and Techniques"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "以下全是对本书125案的计数(非他的学说)：43案标临床痊愈、38案显效、2案有效、无效0案，另4案写“好转”、38案未标等级；诊数中位数4诊；23案配合中药；用得最多的穴是足三里、尺泽、阴陵泉；选经行里太阴经最多；灸出现于51案。",
    "en": "All figures are counts from the 125 cases in this book, not his doctrine: 43 graded clinical recovery, 38 markedly effective, 2 effective, none ineffective; 4 say \"improved\" and 38 carry no grade. Median 4 visits; 23 cases add herbs; most used points Zusanli, Chize, Yinlingquan; Taiyin is the most frequently selected channel; moxa appears in 51 cases."
  },
  "takeaways": [
    {
      "zh": "疗效分级(计数，非学说)：他把疗效分为临床痊愈、显效、有效、无效四级并作电话等随访。125案中临床痊愈43案(34.4%)、显效38案(30.4%)、有效2案，两个最高等级合计81案(64.8%)；标“无效”的0案。另4案用“好转”、38案没有等级词(其中9案只写“痊愈”)。",
      "en": "Grades (counts, not doctrine): he uses four grades and telephone follow-up. Of 125 cases 43 are clinical recovery (34.4%), 38 markedly effective (30.4%), 2 effective; the top two grades total 81 (64.8%). No case is graded ineffective; 4 say \"improved\" and 38 carry no grade word (9 of them only say \"cured\").",
      "cite": [
        "E1",
        "E2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "zh": "诊数(计数)：诊数中位数4、平均6.71(被少数长疗程拉高)；57案(45.6%)在3诊以内，76案(60.8%)在5诊以内，1诊者18案；15诊及以上11案(8.8%)，最长的是案75头痛(66诊)、案22红斑狼疮综合征导致消化不良(50诊)、案117目干涩(27诊)。疼痛症中位数3诊，神经与带状疱疹、五官、神志病中位数均在7.5诊以上。",
      "en": "Visits (counts): median 4, mean 6.71 (pulled up by a few long courses); 57 cases (45.6%) finished within 3 visits, 76 (60.8%) within 5, 18 in a single visit; 11 cases (8.8%) ran to 15 or more, the longest being Case 75 headache (66), Case 22 lupus-related dyspepsia (50) and Case 117 dry eyes (27). Pain has a median of 3; nerve/zoster, sense organs and mind conditions all have medians of 7.5 or more.",
      "cite": [
        "E4",
        "E5",
        "E8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "zh": "中药(计数)：录有中药处方、标“配合中药”的只有23案(18.4%)，其余102案(81.6%)是单纯针灸/灸/手法；23案里神经与带状疱疹5案、妇科4案、呼吸系统3案、疼痛症3案、神志病3案。心血管、消化、泌尿、汗证四组一案也没有。",
      "en": "Herbs (counts): only 23 cases (18.4%) record a herbal prescription; the other 102 (81.6%) are acupuncture, moxa or manual work alone. Of the 23: nerve/zoster 5, gynaecology 4, respiratory 3, pain 3, mind 3; none in the cardiovascular, digestive, urinary or sweating groups.",
      "cite": [
        "E6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "zh": "用穴(计数)：按案计，足三里42案、尺泽40案、阴陵泉37案、太白28案居前，后顶20案(其中疼痛症16案，占该组39案的41.0%)；尺泽与阴陵泉同案出现28案，太渊+太白11案，内关+公孙9案，照海+复溜9案。每案(全部诊次合计)记录的穴位中位数7个、平均9.9个，不等于每次只用这么多。",
      "en": "Points (counts): by cases, Zusanli 42, Chize 40, Yinlingquan 37 and Taibai 28 lead; Houding appears in 20 cases (16 in the pain group, 41.0% of its 39). Chize with Yinlingquan co-occur in 28 cases, Taiyuan+Taibai in 11, Neiguan+Gongsun in 9, Zhaohai+Fuliu in 9. Per case (all visits pooled) the median is 7 points, mean 9.9; this is not a per-treatment number.",
      "cite": [
        "E3",
        "E7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "zh": "选经(计数)：91案有“选经”行，其中太阴经51案(56.0%)最多，其次阳明经38案、太阳经32案、少阴经27案、督脉26案、少阳经26案；124案有“经络诊察”行，太阴经字样出现于75案(60.5%)。按所用穴位的所属经脉计，脾经穴出现于67案、督脉61案、胃经58案。",
      "en": "Channels (counts): 91 cases have a \"selected channel\" line; Taiyin leads with 51 (56.0%), then Yangming 38, Taiyang 32, Shaoyin 27, Du Mai 26, Shaoyang 26. Of 124 cases with a channel-examination line Taiyin is named in 75 (60.5%). By the channel of the points used, Spleen points occur in 67 cases, Du Mai 61, Stomach 58.",
      "cite": [
        "E11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "zh": "手法(计数)：在选穴与各诊记录里，灸见于51案(40.8%)、点(得气即出针)33案、刺络放血25案、操法18案、TDP 5案、拔罐3案；凡例规定未做标注的均为针刺得气后留针20分钟，所以这是“有特殊手法标注”的案数，不是针刺的案数。",
      "en": "Techniques (counts): in the point lines and visit notes moxa appears in 51 cases (40.8%), dian (needle in and out) 33, collateral bloodletting 25, cao manipulation 18, TDP 5, cupping 3. The book's convention is that unmarked points are needled with 20-minute retention, so these are counts of cases with a marked special technique, not of needling.",
      "cite": [
        "E9",
        "E10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "zh": "分科(计数)：疼痛症占39案(31.2%)，是最大的一组，17案临床痊愈、13案显效、中位数3诊；过敏性疾病7案全部标为临床痊愈或显效(3+4)；妇科12案中标临床痊愈3、显效3，另6案未标等级。组内案数很少(儿科3、心血管3、皮肤科3)，不宜比较各组的“有效率”。",
      "en": "By group (counts): pain is the largest group at 39 cases (31.2%): 17 clinical recovery, 13 markedly effective, median 3 visits. All 7 allergic cases are graded clinical recovery or markedly effective (3+4). Of 12 gynaecology cases 3 are clinical recovery and 3 markedly effective, 6 carry no grade. Several groups are tiny (paediatrics 3, cardiovascular 3, dermatology 3), so group \"effective rates\" should not be compared.",
      "cite": [
        "E1"
      ]
    }
  ],
