  "how_to_use": {
    "zh": "把这些数字当作“这本书里的这125案是什么样子”的描述：想知道他某类病常用几诊、常用哪些穴，可查表2、表4、表8；想知道他“选经”倾向，看表6。它们不能替代前面各篇里他自己的论述，也不能当作疗效统计或处方依据。",
    "en": "Read these numbers as a description of the 125 cases in this book: for typical visit counts and common points by group see Tables 2, 4 and 8; for channel tendencies see Table 6. They do not replace his own reasoning in the other guides and are not efficacy statistics or prescribing rules."
  },
  "caveats": {
    "zh": "(1)这是本书125案的计数，不是他全部临床的统计，也不是他的学说；病例由作者挑选，无对照。(2)疗效等级取自各案“疗效”行(以最后出现的“属X”为准)，未标等级不等于无效。(3)诊数取疗效行所述总次数(“共N诊”或“治疗N次…再巩固M次”相加)；未述者取病历所载最后一诊序号，属下限。(4)穴位按案计数，包含各诊及案内解读中记录的全部穴位；“太阳”“阿是穴”“四关”等按原文名称计为经外穴。(5)选经/察经行的经脉是字面统计，手足经不分，且不判断是否为“无异常”。(6)手法为对选穴与各诊文字的检索，剔除了解析标签里“5点醒”“重点”“针灸”这类误报，个别案(如案121“点次”)因原文截断而未计入。(7)原文OCR略有错字，如“阴郄”常缺“郄”。",
    "en": "(1) These are counts from this book's 125 selected cases, not his whole practice and not his doctrine; there is no control group. (2) Grades come from each outcome line (the last \"属X\" wins); \"no grade\" does not mean ineffective. (3) Visits use the total stated in the outcome line (\"N visits\" or \"N treatments plus M consolidation\") and otherwise the last numbered visit recorded, which is a lower bound. (4) Points are counted per case over all visits and the case commentary; Taiyang, ashi points and Siguan are counted as extra points under their printed names. (5) The channel lines are literal counts; hand and foot channels are not separated and a mention such as \"no abnormality\" is not screened out. (6) Techniques were searched in the point and visit text; false hits such as \"5点醒\", \"重点\" and \"针灸\" were removed by hand, and a truncated \"点次\" in Case 121 was not counted. (7) OCR of the source has some errors, e.g. Yinxi often lacks the second character."
  },
